","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255062","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"おかゆ(岡本芽々子、メメコ)","creatorId":"vndb:s9630","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:6851","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9630","name":"おかゆ(岡本芽々子、メメコ)","detail":"彩色","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255063","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"夜島ゆうた","creatorId":"vndb:s19511","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:16928","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19511","name":"夜島ゆうた","detail":"背景","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255064","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"イエローナイン","creatorId":"vndb:s7219","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7219","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7219","name":"イエローナイン","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:103415","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"おかゆ","creatorId":"vndb:s9630","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9630","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9630","name":"岡本芽々子","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:103419","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41397","characterName":"輿水 幸子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41397"},"originalCharacterName":"輿水 幸子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1125"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sachiko is a playful young girl with astounding confidence, priding herself in being the cutest. She denies all her failures and even while falling down an airplane she will try to keep a confident face. She's kind of a sadist, getting a kick out of showing other people how superior she is to them. Her reasons are very self-centered however: she doesn't want people to suffer for no reason or at the hands of others, just suffer because she is better at the task and they become aware of it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sachiko has been shown to be a 4.0 GPA student and will help other idols with their school work without asking anything in return. Additionally, she works hard and is said to have a willpower of steel. She's also very friendly with younger idols. All in all, while Sachiko has a ridiculous ego, she doesn't intentionally want permanent harm on others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41397"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/6757ac9c154c180f181bd7f6c98248f356c21e5b42cbda3f2462df48d7170647.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc1b43272e19e5d58c576955cf92ab866c9ddb6ce087cb6ab64024a61fe6753c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41398","characterName":"双葉 杏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41398"},"originalCharacterName":"双葉 杏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"902"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Anzu is a listless idol and a NEET who doesn't believe in work. Anzu has no particular interests other than playing games, anime, manga and sleeping. She only becomes an idol because she believes she will be able to live the rest of her days off royalties. Her verbal catch phrase is \"I wanna go home!\", and she frequently wears a shirt that says: \"If you work, you lose.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41398"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7ba65ae8a889f3d34d38234b350ccfd12015fe118bc07f194e92820b61413c96.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/998d5166418773c54f05af7c1dfa0d93b58bdcc7ed4536be7607731890cd38d4.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41401","characterName":"城ヶ崎 美嘉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41401"},"originalCharacterName":"城ヶ崎 美嘉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1112"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mika is an idol and a fan of the gal subculture. Like any older sister, she and Rika Jougasaki don't always see eye to eye, and squabble on occasion, but most of the time they get along just fine. Mika really cares for her little sister, and serves as a bit of a role-model for her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41401"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0ac14fe0f9eb97c88ce4ec71c9afc491a5817efeba8c074cf4e733ea020e8f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8f87ed078873abc41d9e87333e67504bf09ccc05e9509dfca2b6b5031cf2ec01.webp","width":220,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41402","characterName":"城ヶ崎 莉嘉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41402"},"originalCharacterName":"城ヶ崎 莉嘉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"12"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"730"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rika Jougasaki is the younger of the Jougasaki sisters. She enjoys playing around and became an idol to be like her sister, Mika Jougasaki, who she admires quite a bit. Like Mika, she is involved in the Gal subculture. However, she considereably more energetic than her sister. She loves to collect bugs and stickers, and will occasionally threaten to bite the Producer if he neglects her. She sometimes gets on Mika’s nerves, but she really doesn't mean it most of the time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41402"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/591d10c32b6ef56de39163ee0eebfccc1ab3f324bddfac429dee310ad0059b79.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1b04b95e0b5688da091175346737f5980b2f16dddb1686a8e5ba49e681e2c395.webp","width":236,"height":231,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41403","characterName":"白坂 小梅","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41403"},"originalCharacterName":"白坂 小梅","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"13"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"328"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"AA"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young 13-year-old girl interested in gothic culture. She seems to like everything related to the horror genre, often tending to scare the other idols. Koume tends to have a cheerful disposition when it comes to horror, thinking that zombies are very cute and saying she thinks it's adorable when they trap people. She's also very shy, and bad at conversing with others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41403"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f6f6d10571d2fa13a12ae9cf658442fbe222b1638c7201324ea313e87b92094.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52dc55b116acf736ddcb61a02788b72c484cbc7bf446c7bf724b422c399f2668.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41404","characterName":"和久井 留美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41404"},"originalCharacterName":"和久井 留美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"407"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rumi is a woman who sacrificed her personal life to put an office career before everything else. She avoided having a social life to dedicate herself to work advancement, and even cut her hair to a boyish length because she didn't want being feminine to be a career issue. Her ambition led her to become a company manager, but also forced her into being single."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41404"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/490c1b739fe70d72175257d7b3e32be24e0a35c8e3809d60f7d3fed9f4990002.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b67ce5ab9164db520376ecbd428240675bd5367d204ecc454c0a9d465e9ee8f0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41405","characterName":"高垣 楓","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41405"},"originalCharacterName":"高垣 楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"614"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kaede is a mature and mysterious idol. She is very quiet, never saying more than necessary. Her hobbies are visiting and relaxing in onsen. She's also is a huge fan of lame puns and can continue for hours with this if the Producer can’t stop it. She can instantly smell the difference between body wash and shampoo products and has a beauty mark under her right eye."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41405"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb2a72ef30991cbcf5599dee9b0beb39edecc0c5c0dcb8716c8490aa1cb90cee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c8e02745cbbbfc3255b81ce092dc3333fc852438512730fd59ee5f7fc76203e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41406","characterName":"龍崎 薫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41406"},"originalCharacterName":"龍崎 薫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"9"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"720"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"AA"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kaoru is very innocent and is well protected from danger by older idols. She is not a very good cook, but has fun trying her best. She holds her time with Producer (who she calls Sensei) very closely to her, and has even come back to school after she walked nearly all the way home just so the Producer could pick her up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41406"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe5f6069780233651842b98351c4524e626187c8f92f56401559586c3b3de577.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc34ceee37b4c13505fbfcb2b1d9d3fbe5e4b74ea981a15db269652f5810f188.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41407","characterName":"及川 雫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41407"},"originalCharacterName":"及川 雫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"603"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shizuku is a cheerful rural girl, born and raised on a dairy farm. She has strong work ethics, a positive outlook on life, and an unlimited love for cows. With a catch phrase of \"Moo♪\", she carries the motif of her favorite animal, specifically the black and white heifers known as Holstein Friesian cattle. As the daughter of a farmer from the countryside of the Iwate Prefecture, she is not ignorant of technology and the times but still finds city life new and exciting."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Project IM@S Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41407"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8f073100244e1263fba9c7a4c0bc2d89859864f9241c0dae76348705e924e9a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f290f19f9933947586b1ce108fe816a9a26400653bf22b2959c39f80d9838b44.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p2330","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2349","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2330","name":"セイバーフィッシュ","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:33266:2349","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2330","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2330","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2330","name":"セイバーフィッシュ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:33876:v13568","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2330","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2330","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2330","name":"セイバーフィッシュ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:33877:v13568","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
